      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "C6F9AC8C0A673AC3",
      "text": "Hmm, no, I don’t think that’s it. That’s not even a\\nbug Pokémon, is it?\\c\\nIt was letting out a little cry, like so: “Jol! Jol!”\\nOh, could it have been a Joltik?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
